<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON ORDER OF PLAY ON THE SHOW COURTS ON WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON ORDER OF PLAY ON THE SHOW COURTS ON WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wednesday's singles order of play</p>
<p>for matches on the show courts at the Wimbledon tennis</p>
<p>championships (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Centre Court (starts 1100GMT)</p>
<p>4-Iva Majoli (Croatia) v Anna Kournikova (Russia)</p>
<p>14-Tim Henman (Britain) v 4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) to</p>
<p>finish</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Denisa Chladkova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic)</p>
<p>Court One (1100GMT)</p>
<p>3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) v Yayuk Bazuki (Indonesia)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v 16-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) to</p>
<p>finish</p>
<p>8-Aranxta Sanchez Vicario (Spain) v Nathalie Tauziat (France)</p>
</text>
